<title>SRI LANKA: Former President Jayewardene dies.</title>
<headline>Former President Jayewardene dies.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Sri Lankan president Junius Richard Jayewardene died on Friday at the age of 90, his United National Party said.</p>
<p>Jayewardene ruled the Indian Ocean island for 11 years from 1977 to 1988 as prime minister and as its first executive president.</p>
